Regression test for the missing `Chain.invoke()` boundary above. On Python 3.12, both success/error cases fail at `child.parent == workflow.context` on this PR and pass on main and with the suggested fix, on both tested versions. The unavailable import path is skipped; the latest test environment needs `langchain-classic` installed to exercise that path. Uses the imports and shared fixtures already in this file.

